//--------------------------------
//      NPC 1 Quesline
//--------------------------------
title: NPC1Introduction
---
    Macklemor: Oh boy coming out of that book sure was scary, good thing I don't get spooked easy!
    You: Hello?
    Macklemor: AAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!  Oh.. Hi!... Dont sneak up on me like that!
    You: Sorry!
    Macklemor: Wait... I know you! You are our creator! Did you really have to draw me besides Doge Fish, he won't stop barking.
    You: Sorry about that... I was actually wondering if you could help me out?
    Macklemor: Oh so you need my help? Well I did get this boat that could be used to travel, how I got it?.... Internet.
    You: Perfect! That will help me!
    Macklemor: Wa wa wa wait! Not so fast. I need to make sure you even are our artist!
    You: What?
    Macklemor: I will give you the keys to the boat if you show me you caught all 3 fish found here in Doodlefish Bay.
    You: That makes absolutely no sense but... ok...
    Narrator: QUEST STARTED
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

